{number: 159}
{title: His Name Is Wonderful}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
His [C] name is Wonderful,
His [G7] name is Wonderful,
His [C] name is [F] Wonderful,
[C] Jesus my [G7] Lord;
He is the [C] mighty King,
Master of [G7] everything,
His [C] name is [F] Wonderful,
[C] Jesus, [G7] my [C] Lord.
He's the [G7] great Shepherd, the [C] Rock of all ages,
Al-[D7] mighty God is [G7] He;
Bow [C] down before Him, love and a-[G7] dore Him,
His [C] name is [F] Wonderful, [C] Jesus [G7] my [C] Lord.
{end_of_verse}
